HST Office: feature search box in the ribbon tab row, after the last tab.

Owner decision (2026-11-07 12:17): the box follows the last tab ("Phần mở rộng") and fills the row up
to the menu button; about 200 logical px at least while there is room, then it shrinks, then it shows
only a magnifier. Placeholder "Tìm tính năng… (Alt+Q)" (English UI: "Search features… (Alt+Q)"),
a magnifier, an even 1 px border with a 4 px radius, light and dark; high contrast uses system colours.

- sfx2/source/notebookbar/NotebookbarTabControl.cxx, sfx2/inc/notebookbar/NotebookbarTabControl.hxx:
  HstTabSearchBox (child id "hst-tab-search"), created with the banner for the Tabbed notebookbar of
  Writer, Calc and Impress. A click, Enter, Space, keyboard focus (Tab or F6) or a typed character
  calls sfx2::hst::ShowFeatureSearch(box, text) from <notebookbar/HstFeatureSearch.hxx> when that
  header exists (feature search stream), else dispatches .uno:CommandPopup. Accessible as a push
  button named like the placeholder.
- vcl/source/control/tabctrl.cxx: NotebookbarTabControlBase::ImplPlaceTabs reserves the box's room
  before giving tabs their minimum width, keeps the tabs left-aligned when the box exists, and
  places it; with no room at all it is hidden (Alt+Q still works). Other tab controls unchanged.

